{title:BNR mortality Step 4: Prepare the review package}

{title:What this step does}

{pstd}
Step 4 checks the private mortality metrics, applies the approved disclosure
rules and creates the complete candidate and review evidence. It does not
approve or publish the release.

{title:Before you run it}

{pstd}
Mortality Step 3 must have completed for the selected period with its required
QA checks passing.

{title:What to enter}

{phang}{bf:Release year and month} identify the completed Step 3 package.

{phang}{bf:Authorise replacement} should normally remain unticked. If the
candidate is rebuilt, discard any earlier review and repeat it in full.

{title:After running}

{pstd}
Review the complete candidate, review workbook and QA evidence. Resolve any
problem at its source and rerun the necessary earlier step. When review is
complete and satisfactory, continue to mortality Step 5.

{title:Full instructions}

{pstd}
See the {browse "https://uwi-bnr.github.io/info-hub/technical/workflows/mortality/review.html":Technical Manual: Review the mortality data package}.
